@*
    _SponsorStrip.cshtml — partner-logo footer strip.

    Spec 037 D7: renders a SINGLE official combined-partner image
    (~/lib/brand/partners-footer.png — Banca para el Desarrollo · CROCUS · nexo ·
    De la mano con su PYME · Programa Semilla), centered and responsive, with a
    yellow (--color-accent) 3px top border supplied by .fl-sponsor-strip in
    tokens.css. Replaces the five per-sponsor SVGs.

    Preserved contract: the <footer data-testid="sponsor-strip"> element, the
    HideOnPrint reflection, and aria-label — so BrandPresence*Tests and
    PrintLayoutTests stay green; only VisualRegression snapshots refresh.

    Optional model: anonymous { HideOnPrint = bool }. Pass HideOnPrint=true
    on application detail and reviewer queue / detail surfaces (research R13);
    omit / pass false on auth surfaces and the bare _Layout.
*@
@{
    // Read HideOnPrint without `dynamic` — _Layout passes the parent view's
    // model through to the partial, so a typed model without `HideOnPrint`
    // would otherwise raise RuntimeBinderException. Reflection probes the
    // member safely; absent → defaults to false. Caller surfaces opt-in by
    // invoking with an anonymous `new { HideOnPrint = true }`.
    var hideOnPrint = Model?.GetType()
        .GetProperty("HideOnPrint", System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Instance | System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Public)
        ?.GetValue(Model) is bool flag && flag;
}
@* When hideOnPrint is true, Razor emits data-print-hide="sponsor-strip";
   when null/false, Razor suppresses the attribute entirely (built-in
   conditional-attribute idiom — keeps the attribute well-formed). *@
<footer class="fl-sponsor-strip"
        data-testid="sponsor-strip"
        data-print-hide="@(hideOnPrint ? "sponsor-strip" : null)"
        aria-label="Patrocinadores">
    <img src="~/lib/brand/partners-footer.png"
         class="fl-sponsor-image"
         alt="Sistema de Banca para el Desarrollo · CROCUS · nexo · De la mano con su PYME · Programa Semilla"
         data-sponsor="partners" />
</footer>
